title = Citadis 403
description = Citadis is a family of low-floor trams and light rail vehicles built by Alstom. As of 2025, over 8,000 Citadis trams have been ordered, with operations in over 140 cities on all six inhabited continents. The Citadis 403 boasts a length of 45 meters with its 7-car formation, specially made for the city of Strasbourg.
